      ],
      "observed": "Muzzle flash/tracer, cyan impact marker and localized red spray are visible on successive shots while the target remains upright and continues approaching. The marker fades and refreshes across the sequence. A detached orange forearm falls to the floor while the target continues moving.",
      "qualification": "The body and joint movement remains angular. This view does not isolate subtle hit flinch from locomotion and limb separation, and does not determine exact hit region."
